{"data": [{"author_id": "16359050", "created_at": "2026-10-21T22:38:42.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2113037290109059236"], "id": "2113037290109059236", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 46, "like_count": 1, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 1, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2113034347511173186", "type": "quoted"}], "text": "The bros are being played. \n\nThe fertility rate stat (TFR) is artificially low because our behaviour is changing - fewer teens and more 40yos are having babies. \n\nThe CFR completed fertility rate - i.e. births over your lifetime. Is around 2 and hasn't changed for two decades. https://t.co/4E6BaBmwxF", "url": "https://x.com/fionamarycamero/status/2113037290109059236"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["3_2113053895228309504"]}, "author_id": "2568178637", "created_at": "2026-10-21T23:44:42.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2113053898659258872"], "id": "2113053898659258872", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 1, "impression_count": 901, "like_count": 7, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 1, "retweet_count": 2}, "text": "The TFR for the Diddler-in-Chief's visit to Port Huron this weekend. TC has a NOTAM for it as well https://t.co/IjtSiz33Zz", "url": "https://x.com/CAlexMasse/status/2113053898659258872"}, {"author_id": "1537525782867763204", "created_at": "2026-10-22T00:10:13.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2113060319132004597"], "id": "2113060319132004597", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 29, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2112891692126777817", "type": "quoted"}], "text": "the low population low TFR counties in california and arizona are the best ones to live in lol https://t.co/GDVrR6jgAI", "url": "https://x.com/RanierGrant/status/2113060319132004597"}, {"author_id": "1990840486320615430", "created_at": "2026-10-21T21:10:00.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2113014966135497141"], "id": "2113014966135497141", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 51, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "🚨 AIRSPACE ALERT | NORTHEAST–ATLANTA 🇺🇸\n\nFAA is rerouting JFK, PHL and some Northeast departures to ATL from 5–10pm ET due to special operations/TFR. No specific delay is stated.\n\nCheck airline + True Skies app.\n\n#TrueSkiesFlightTracker #TravelAlert #JFK #PHL #ATL", "url": "https://x.com/trueskiesapp/status/2113014966135497141"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["3_2113046037694722048"]}, "author_id": "1366893605634383872", "created_at": "2026-10-21T23:13:30.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2113046044745609306"], "id": "2113046044745609306", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 39, "like_count": 1, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "🎃NEW EPISODE!!!🎃\nOn this installment of TFR, Eric &amp; Joe chat about the finale of The Long Halloween saga. #Batman: The Last Halloween is now in your podcast feeds! 🦇 https://t.co/Pd3LDCHeN3", "url": "https://x.com/TFRBatPod/status/2113046044745609306"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["3_2112924263808368640"]}, "author_id": "19059272", "created_at": "2026-10-21T23:00:03.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2113042660718248310"], "id": "2113042660718248310", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 1, "impression_count": 1489, "like_count": 4, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 1}, "text": "สัญญาประชาคมข้ามรุ่น แก่ สุขภาพดี และมีเงินใช้ | #บทบรรณาธิการกรุงเทพธุรกิจ\n\nประเทศไทยเข้าสู่ “สังคมสูงวัยอย่างสมบูรณ์” ตั้งแต่ปี 2023 และกำลังมุ่งหน้าสู่ “สังคมสูงวัยระดับสุดยอด” ภายในปี 2033 เกิดขึ้นท่ามกลางข้อจำกัดเชิงโครงสร้างที่ประเทศไทย “แก่ก่อนรวย” https://t.co/kAzdZO46lU", "url": "https://x.com/ktnewsonline/status/2113042660718248310"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["7_2113060689354833920"]}, "author_id": "1662992490033471490", "created_at": "2026-10-22T00:12:03.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2113060782095138924"], "id": "2113060782095138924", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 0, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "A shocking medical reveal explaining how losing 144 pounds reversed severe hormonal issues and restored fertility for a young couple. https://t.co/tWJRo0LsEH", "url": "https://x.com/Jamarcu67272718/status/2113060782095138924"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["3_2113060002433044480"]}, "author_id": "2108732375371051008", "created_at": "2026-10-22T00:09:01.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2113060015615701286"], "id": "2113060015615701286", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 1, "impression_count": 241, "like_count": 13, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 2, "retweet_count": 10}, "text": "❤️ Planning for a baby? Knowing when to see a fertility specialist can make all the difference.\n\nEarly consultation can help identify possible issues, reduce stress, and guide you toward the right treatment. 💕\n\nFollow me @quantumaix8 for more https://t.co/c1hkwPTuVi", "url": "https://x.com/quantumaix8/status/2113060015615701286"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["3_2111552722730094592"]}, "author_id": "1891905206998245376", "created_at": "2026-10-22T00:00:01.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2113057750376907115"], "id": "2113057750376907115", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 1, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "🇫🇷 France has the highest fertility rate of Europe's big economies. 🇮🇹 Italy has one of the lowest.\n\nBirths per woman:\n1980: France 1.95, Italy 1.65\n2026: France 1.64, Italy 1.22\n\nSource: UN projections, World Population Prospects 2024 https://t.co/0P5yzPlJJl", "url": "https://x.com/measuredworld/status/2113057750376907115"}, {"author_id": "2281228142", "created_at": "2026-10-22T00:13:14.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2113061078233989361"], "id": "2113061078233989361", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 17, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "How Danish sperm became central to the global donor industry.\nhttps://t.co/L3bVUgo5i3 #Denmark #SpermBank #Fertility #SpermDonation #HealthNews", "url": "https://x.com/vtbcfeed/status/2113061078233989361"}, {"author_id": "1251900966770794498", "created_at": "2026-10-21T23:28:46.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2113049889148137749"], "id": "2113049889148137749", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 63, "impression_count": 20241, "like_count": 2374, "quote_count": 3, "reply_count": 69, "retweet_count": 264}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2112563974046957792", "type": "quoted"}], "text": "The fertility crisis in the West has nothing to do with fertility and everything to do with abortion \n\nIf western women weren’t murdering their babies on a scale that makes the Holocaust look quaint most countries would be above replacement https://t.co/gvKHMQYCOk", "url": "https://x.com/AuronMacintyre/status/2113049889148137749"}, {"author_id": "1006606353480208384", "created_at": "2026-10-22T00:06:23.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2113059353435451551"], "id": "2113059353435451551", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 104, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2113043613823189363", "type": "quoted"}], "text": "A man was having a verbal confrontation with police whilst guns were pointed at him, and her thought process was to then grab a baby, and have it intercept where the guns were pointed? Her subscription to fertility needs to end https://t.co/pdy1p6zIuP", "url": "https://x.com/Dee_chzn1/status/2113059353435451551"}, {"author_id": "1527627061983973376", "created_at": "2026-10-21T23:00:02.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2113042656272261335"], "id": "2113042656272261335", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 124, "like_count": 0, "quote_count