/_bella_baxter/status/2113049891089895517"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["3_2053424253685690368"]}, "author_id": "33856936", "created_at": "2026-10-21T21:30:00.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2113020000638578711"], "id": "2113020000638578711", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 128, "impression_count": 12528, "like_count": 416, "quote_count": 17, "reply_count": 30, "retweet_count": 96}, "text": "Across countries, greater gender equality is associated with lower fertility.\n\nhttps://t.co/22sYVLFv58 https://t.co/q4Q3a1DTq7", "url": "https://x.com/SteveStuWill/status/2113020000638578711"}, {"author_id": "1048861054556680192", "created_at": "2026-10-21T23:00:51.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2113042862682366224"], "id": "2113042862682366224", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 238, "like_count": 3, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2112924368422473946", "type": "quoted"}], "text": "Male fertility doctors treat women specially.  The best men to marry. He knows and understands your pain. https://t.co/UB7tr3iIWl", "url": "https://x.com/Crownthecook/status/2113042862682366224"}, {"author_id": "2087263201583087616", "created_at": "2026-10-21T21:12:00.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2113015468273357058"], "id": "2113015468273357058", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 6, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "Does adding metformin improve fertility-sparing treatment for early endometrial neoplasia?\n\nRead more on MedXY:\nhttps://t.co/EF2HvJybkK\n#Oncology #WomensHealth #ClinicalTrials #MedXY", "url": "https://x.com/AIMedSci/status/2113015468273357058"}, {"author_id": "1350848328829952010", "created_at": "2026-10-21T21:00:04.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2113012467294929230"], "id": "2113012467294929230", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 52, "impression_count": 8982, "like_count": 83, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 9, "retweet_count": 76}, "text": "My husband’s family thinks I’m infertile. I let them spend $40,000 on fertility treatments for me while secretly taking birth control.\n\nBefore you call me evil, understand that my husband, Andrew, has always wanted children. He told me that before our first date, before he", "url": "https://x.com/_shola__/status/2113012467294929230"}], "includes": {"media": [{"media_key": "3_2113053895228309504", "type": "photo"}, {"media_key": "3_2113046037694722048", "type": "photo"}, {"media_key": "3_2112924263808368640", "type": "photo"}, {"media_key": "7_2113060689354833920", "type": "video"}, {"media_key": "3_2113060002433044480", "type": "photo"}, {"media_key": "3_2111552722730094592", "type": "photo"}, {"media_key": "3_2113013240363986944", "type": "photo"}, {"media_key": "3_2053424253685690368", "type": "photo"}], "users": [{"id": "16359050", "name": "fionamarycameron", "username": "fionamarycamero"}, {"id": "2568178637", "name": "Alex Masse", "username": "CAlexMasse"}, {"id": "1537525782867763204", "name": "Ranier Styles Grant", "username": "RanierGrant"}, {"id": "1990840486320615430", "name": "True Skies", "username": "trueskiesapp"}, {"id": "1366893605634383872", "name": "The Fire Rises", "username": "TFRBatPod"}, {"id": "19059272", "name": "กรุงเทพธุรกิจ", "username": "ktnewsonline"}, {"id": "1662992490033471490", "name": "Jamarcus", "username": "Jamarcu67272718"}, {"id": "2108732375371051008", "name": "Quantum", "username": "quantumaix8"}, {"id": "1891905206998245376", "name": "Measured World", "username": "measuredworld"}, {"id": "2281228142", "name": "VTBC ┋", "username": "vtbcfeed"}, {"id": "1251900966770794498", "name": "Auron MacIntyre", "username": "AuronMacintyre"}, {"id": "1006606353480208384", "name": "Devzzz", "username": "Dee_chzn1"}, {"id": "1527627061983973376", "name": "Shrimp Cake🦐🍤🇧🇩", "username": "shrimpcakecake"}, {"id": "96777267", "name": "Peter Nooski", "username": "laten_c"}, {"id": "1525114416899010